Additional Medium (500 XP) Quests:
*Win 5 battles in a specific [[Event]] / with a specific [[Brawler]] / in any of 2 specific Events / with any of 3 specific Brawlers
*Defeat 15 enemies in a specific Event / with a specific Brawler / in any of 2 specific Events / with any of 3 specific Brawlers
*Heal 50000 points in a specific Event / with a specific Brawler / in any of 2 specific Events / with any of 3 specific Brawlers
*Deal 100000 points of damage in a specific Event / with a specific Brawler / in any of 2 specific Events / with any of 3 specific Brawlers
*Use "Play again" 10 times
*Play 5 matches in a team

===Mega Quests===
Mega Quests are a series of hard Quests that, when accomplished, give out an extra reward with the XP, such as resources or loot drops. Finishing one Mega Quest unlocks the next one, up to 13 Quests per season, and the last two quests are Brawl Pass-exclusive. Mega Quests currently in progress can be switched to a different one from 3 choices. These Quests can be switched indefinitely and do not consume a Quest reroll.

:'''Mega Quests''' - 1500 XP and a reward each:
*Win 15 battles
*Defeat 20 enemies
*Deal 300,000 points of damage
*Heal 100,000 points of health
*Gain 80 Trophies

:'''Super Mega Quests''' - 3000 XP and double rewards each:
*Defeat 30 enemies
*Win 30 battles
*Play 60 battles
*Deal 500,000 damage
*Gain 120 Trophies

