==History==
*13/05/20:
**The first Brawl Pass was added to the game.
*04/06/20:
**Quests have been divided into categories (Daily, Season, Event).
**Quest icons in the Event Selection are now shortcut buttons to the Quest log.
**Brawler menu now has a Quest filter button which sorts Brawlers with Quests to the top of the Brawler list.
**Brawl Pass now has shortcut buttons to navigate between rewards and milestones inside the track.
**Brawl Pass now remembers the previously viewed tab when accessed through the main Brawl Pass button.
**Brawl Pass Exclusive Quests are now highlighted for Premium Pass owners (now highlighted gold instead of white).
**Brawl Pass exclusive Quests have been moved to the end of the list for Free Pass players.
**Gem counter is now visible in the Brawl Pass screen.
**Local notifications for Quests becoming available have been added.
*16/12/21:
**Brawl Pass Seasons no longer last 10 weeks but will start on the first Monday of every other month.
**Daily Quests now grant 200 Tokens (from 100).
**4 Medium Quests (250 Tokens) were changed to Hard Quests (500 Tokens).
**6 Medium Brawl Pass Quests were changed to Hard Quests.
*27/04/22:
**Brawl Pass Quests can now be rerolled and new event-specific Quests were added.
*29/06/22:
**The number of Quests that can be rerolled per week was increased to 2 (from 1) for free users and 5 (from 3) for players with a Brawl Pass activated.
**Brawl Pass can now be activated in the Shop.
*25/10/22:
**Generic Quests were added and replaced one of the Daily Quests.
*12/12/22:
**[[Credits]] and Chroma Credits were added to the Brawl Pass and replaced [[Brawl Boxes]], as they were removed from the game.
*16/12/22:
**Fixed a bug where the Quest re-roll charges longer than the normal time.
*25/04/23:
**Small Quests can now be unlocked after reaching 100 [[Trophies]].
**Brawl Pass Bundle was reworked from automatically progressing a certain number of tiers depending on how many tiers have been unlocked already for 249 [[Gems]] to automatically progressing 5 tiers for $9.99 USD.
*27/06/23:
**Some event-specific Quests, the heal Generic Quest, and the social Quest were removed and replaced with choice of three Brawlers Quests, and choice of two events Quests.
**Exclusive Quests can now be progressed without buying the Brawl Pass.
*29/06/23:
**Fixed the Quest markers being visible on events without an active Quest.
*24/10/23:
**Small Quests can now be unlocked after reaching 60 [[Trophies]], and the Medium and Hard Quest can now be unlocked after reaching 250 Trophies.
*12/12/23:
**Brawl Pass Seasons now start on the first Thursday of every month.
**The Brawl Pass now costs $6.99 (instead of 169 Gems). The Brawl Pass Plus was added. The Brawl Pass Bundle was removed.
**Medium Quests now grant 500 XP (from 250) and appear daily.
**Hard Quests (500 XP) were removed.
**The number of Quests that can be rerolled per week was increased to 5 (from 2) for free users.
*25/06/24:
**The social Quest was added back.
**A Brawl Pass Season can be bought for $2.99 by players who never purchased a Brawl Pass season before and by players who haven't purchased it in six months.
*04/09/25:
**The rewards from the free track were increased. Tier 0 now grants 1000 Coins (from 500), tier 1 now grants 1000 Power Points (from 500), tier 25 replaces a Starr Drop with 300 Credits, tiers 26 and 28 rewards were swapped, and tier 48 now grants 3500 Coins (from 1000).
**Local prices were adjusted in over 100 countries in Latin America, Africa, Eastern Europe, and Southeast and Central Asia.
*28/10/25:
**Mega Quests were added.
**"Play Battles" and "Win Trophies" generic Quests were added.
**Daily Quests now can only be generic Quests.
**Quests are now displayed in 3 rows instead of 2.
*01/01/26:
**1 Resource Key, 6 Chaos Drops, 200 Bling, 2 Mega Boxes were added in the free tracks. Rewards are increased to 12500 Coins (from 11500) and to 3600 Power Points (from 3000) and 1400 Credits (from 1300) and decreased to 18 Starr Drops (from 23).
**1 Resource, Skin and Brawler Keys and the Title were added to the Brawl Pass tracks. Rewards were increased to 9500 Coins (from 8000), 2500 Power Points (from 2000), 3200 Bling (from 2200), 2500 Credits (from 2000). The amount of Pins was decreased to 5 (from 9), and Brawl Pass Skins were removed.
**1 Resource, Skin, Brawler and Buffie Keys were added to the Brawl Pass Plus tracks. Rewards were increased to 100 Gems (from 50). The Title and 2 Brawl Pass Chroma skins were removed.
**The prices of Brawl Pass and Brawl Pass Plus were increased to $8.99 (from $6.99) and $12.99 (from $9.99) respectively.
**The amount of Tiers was increased to 60 (from 50).
**Bonus rewards were reworked. The amount of needed Brawl Pass XP was increased to 2800 (from 1600). Bonus rewards can now be different (in place of Random Starr Drop) and be upgraded for Gems.
**2 more Mega Quests were added to the chain. Mega Quests total switch options were decreased to 3 (from 4). All Mega Quest requirements were lowered. Mega Quests were changed to generic Quests only, and more generic very hard Mega Quests were added.
*07/05/26:
**Tier 56 now grants 2000 Bling (from 200) on the free track. Tiers 50 and 60 rewards were also swapped.

